OL,3,GNEWSAHelp at risk for people in
OL,4,A'cherished' housing estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project which helps council tenants
OL,7,Fin one of England's most deprived areas
OL,8,Fis under threat amid funding cuts.
OL,10,FVolunteer-run scheme Street Reps was
OL,11,Finitially started by Swindon Borough
OL,12,FCouncil in 2015 to improve
OL,13,Fcommunication with tenants but has
OL,14,Fexpanded to include a youth club,
OL,15,Fstreet cleaning and more.
OL,17,FDi Pithers, a street rep on the Penhill
OL,18,Festate, said the area was "cherished"
OL,19,Fand "everybody there had something to
OL,20,Fgive - a skill, a story, a memory, a
OL,21,Fhistory - something they can share with
OL,22,Fthis community, for this community".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
